0_AQUJs9GJxAKbeOoAO0zH7gzswmCGSylmzsadPAHDGNJGWQ&oe=6B0F1CD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Ladnscape_Applab_DEF.png", "id": "1318650725290954", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75287555_1318650731957620_4399606145434759838_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-evB1W87VtAQ7kNvwFvKlc2&_nc_oc=AdpDdzmiiyftjFhmRIi7x6nK-dNtjRBRK5wZAUQz_yvwT9cPogJKg_8zn-QZMs1vwgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUp2eu-3_a4iiBaBf09gGC4ovAjFi0But3azwd2j33H7A&oe=6B0F1475"}, "display_name": "UltrasClash V", "keywords": [], "long_description": "** THIS PRODUCT IS IN EARLY ACCESS, IT MAY CONTAIN SOME GLITCHES, because we believe that the best way to develop the game is with the help of the community**\n\nUltrasClash V is a physics based, fast paced anime combat!!! Fight hordes of hostile and powerful enemies like cactus head policemen, stupid minionsand giant dinosaur in a desperate, yet unmistakably hilarious, fight for survival.\n\nIn Ultrasclash V the combat is limited only by your own creativity. Choose your fighting style, choose your weapons, chose you powers. Be the powerful fighter you always dreamed of becoming!\n\nFEATURES\n\n\ud83d\udc4aPunch Movement System: we created a VR locomotion system which allows you to move punching in the direction you choose to move to!\n\n\u26a1\ufe0fSpecial Attacks: Charge up your aura to full power and unleash devastating finishing moves!\n\n\u2604\ufe0fPhysical engine: we bring you accurate physics feedbacks in addition to badass sounds and enemies!\n\n\ud83e\uddbeMOD KIT Support coming soon...", "short_description": "UltrasClash V is a sandbox anime action game, designed and primed to bring you a unique and creative approach to being a hero and unleash all your super powers!"}]}, "developer_name": "IOX S.r.l.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ultrasclash.com/3009-2/", "developer_terms_of_servic